        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 7 In this case the EVCC will follow [V2G20-2097], [V2G20-2098] or [V2G20-5046], depending on the energy transfer mode selected. Authorization from previous V2G communication session is used. As such the EVCC will bypass the authorization messages.",
