        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2628] If a new SessionID was assigned per [V2G20-2627] or [V2G20-2547], the SECC shall consider this as a new V2G session. The SECC shall not apply any previously stored authorizations to this new V2G session. The SECC shall expect and require the EVCC to follow normal steps to setup a new V2G session with new authorizations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                890,
                1121,
                995
